			"notes": "First release for NeoForge and hotfix release for Fabric.\n\n**Changes for Spigot**:\n\n- No changes were made.\n\n**Changes for Fabric**:\n\n- [Minecraft SQLite JDBC](https://modrinth.com/plugin/minecraft-sqlite-jdbc) is now marked as a hard requirement.\n- [fabric-permissions-api](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-permissions-api) is now marked as a soft requirement. If you do not have this mod, it will fall back to the hardcoded operator/everyone defaults for command permissions.\n\n**Changes for NeoForge**:\n\n- The SQLite driver is bundled with the plugin since I could not get it to work with the 26.1.2 version of the Minecraft SQLite JDBC library. Everything else should be the same as Fabric and Spigot. \n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ganyuke/Invitation/compare/v0.2.0...v0.3.1"
		}
